---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { privacyNav } from '../nav';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Kyra Labs"
  nav={privacyNav}
  homeHref="/"
  footer={{
    statement: 'Privacy should be the quiet default.',
    link: { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
  }}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="description" content="How Kyra Labs handles the information you share on kyralabs.dev." />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://kyralabs.dev/privacy.html" />
  </Fragment>

  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <article class="m3e-card m3e-card--elevated legal" data-reveal>
      <header class="legal-header">
        <p class="signal">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: July 2026</p>
      </header>

      <p>Kyra Labs (referred to as “we”, “us”, the “studio”) operates kyralabs.dev. This policy covers this website only. Spenzia and any other Kyra Labs app has its own privacy policy, linked from that app’s page and its Play Store listing.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>This site collects the minimum needed to respond to you:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email address</strong> — only if you submit it through the notify-me signup or contact form, so we can notify you about app launches or reply to your message.</li>
        <li><strong>Basic server logs</strong> — standard hosting logs (IP address, browser type, pages visited) kept by our hosting provider for security and reliability. We do not run our own analytics or advertising trackers on this site.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To send you a one-time notification when a new app or feature launches, if you signed up to be notified.</li>
        <li>To reply to messages sent through the contact form or email.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your email with advertisers or third parties. We do not use it for anything beyond what you signed up for.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Notify-me emails are kept until the relevant app launches (at which point we send the one notification and you can ask us to delete it) or until you ask us to remove it, whichever comes first.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@kyralabs.dev">contact@kyralabs.dev</a> at any time to ask what we hold about you, or to have it deleted. We’ll action it within a reasonable time.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site does not set marketing or tracking cookies. Your browser may store basic technical preferences (like theme or scroll position) locally on your device; these never leave your browser.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes meaningfully, we’ll update the date at the top of this page.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Kyra Labs is an independent studio run by one developer, not a registered company. For anything privacy-related, reach out at <a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@kyralabs.dev">contact@kyralabs.dev</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
